{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":248,"count":36,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-02\",\"昨天\",\"昨天\",\"昨天\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你昨天幾點回家？","pinyin":"Nǐ zuótiān jǐ diǎn huí jiā?","english":"What time did you go home yesterday?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-02","sourceFront":"昨天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"宜文昨天幾點睡覺？","pinyin":"Yíwén zuótiān jǐ diǎn shuìjiào?","english":"What time did Yiwen go to sleep yesterday?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-3-09","sourceFront":"睡覺","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"昨天我們一起去圖書館。","pinyin":"Zuótiān wǒmen yìqǐ qù túshūguǎn.","english":"We went to the library together yesterday.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-20","sourceFront":"一起","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"昨(yesterday) + 天(day) → the day before today: 昨天(yesterday)."},{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-09\",\"块\",\"塊\",\"块\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一枝筆幾塊錢？","pinyin":"Yì zhī bǐ jǐ kuài qián?","english":"How much is a pen?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-10","sourceFront":"錢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們買兩枝，好不好？兩枝五十塊錢。","pinyin":"Wǒmen mǎi liǎng zhī, hǎo bù hǎo? Liǎng zhī wǔshí kuài qián.","english":"How about we buy two of them? Two for 50NT dollars.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"五十塊錢很便宜！妳看，哪個顏色漂亮？","pinyin":"Wǔshí kuài qián hěn piányí! Nǐ kàn, nǎ ge yánsè piàoliang?","english":"It is inexpensive! Look, which color is better?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這些東西一共兩萬三千五百零五塊。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng liǎng wàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi líng wǔ kuài.","english":"These stuff cost twenty three thousand, five hundred and five dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-20","sourceFront":"零","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個杯子一百多塊錢。","pinyin":"Zhè ge bēizi yì bǎi duō kuài qián.","english":"This cup is over a hundred dollars.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-23","sourceFront":"多","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百一十五塊錢。","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi yīshíwǔ kuài qián.","english":"It will be 215 dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"找您七百八十五塊錢，謝謝。","pinyin":"Zhǎo nín qī bǎi bāshíwǔ kuài qián, xièxie.","english":"Here is your 785 dollars of change, thanks.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百多塊錢，好便宜！","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi duō kuài qián, hǎo piányi!","english":"It is only a little over 200. It is cheap!","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L10-3-06\",\"告訴\",\"告訴\",\"告诉\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我很擔心他，請他去看醫生，也告訴他要聽醫生的話，不要忘記多喝水、多休息。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn dānxīn tā, qǐng tā qù kàn yīshēng, yě gàosu tā yào tīng yīshēng de huà, bú yào wàngjì duō hē shuǐ, duō xiūxí.","english":"I’m so worried about him, so I told him to go see a doctor. I also told him to listen to the doctor, to drink plenty of water and get some rest.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"告(tell) + 訴(tell) → 'tell-tell': 告訴 means to tell someone."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-04\",\"卡片\",\"卡片\",\"卡片\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這是我朋友送我的生日卡片。","pinyin":"Zhè shì wǒ péngyou sòng wǒ de shēngrì kǎpiàn.","english":"This is the birthday card my friend gave me.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-04","sourceFront":"卡片","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"莫以凡寫了一張卡片，感謝台灣朋友對他的幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-32","sourceFront":"感謝","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張太太上個月生了一個女兒，我寫了一張卡片祝福她，希望孩子快快樂樂地長大。 我的孩子滿月時，收到很多朋友送的禮物和滿滿的祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-11","sourceFront":"祝福","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我男朋友親手做了一張卡片，還買了一個漂亮的背包送給我， 他的心意讓我很感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-05","sourceFront":"心意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不斷複習生字卡片能幫我們記住新的字。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-35","sourceFront":"記住","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"卡(card) + 片(flat piece) → a flat card: 卡片(card)."},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-09\",\"杀价\",\"殺價\",\"杀价\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在夜市買東西的時候，有些人會跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-10","sourceFront":"殺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那件名牌長裙才兩千元而已，用不著跟老闆殺價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-20","sourceFront":"而已","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-28\",\"鹹\",\"鹹\",\"咸\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個菜放了太多鹽，鹹死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-36","sourceFront":"鹽","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"吃太鹹或太甜的東西，對身體都不好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-04","sourceFront":"或","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:醫生說我應該多運動，少吃太鹹、太油的東西，這樣才不容易生病。 B:就是說嘛！我跟你說過好多次了，你怎麼不聽呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-45","sourceFront":"就是說嘛","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要讓身體健康，得先注意飲食，少吃太油、太鹹的食物；其次要培養每天運動的好習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-19","sourceFront":"其次","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那道菜一點兒都不鹹，我猜或許是忘了放鹽巴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-38","sourceFront":"鹽巴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我最近皮膚又紅又癢，暫時不能吃太辣或太鹹的食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-53","sourceFront":"癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-09\",\"草地\",\"草地\",\"草地\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"林明生躺在草地上看星星，他感覺真輕鬆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-19","sourceFront":"輕鬆","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個星期六，我們要在社區的草地上辦活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-10","sourceFront":"辦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"奶奶把變黃的蔬菜葉子埋在地裡，讓它變成草地的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-40","sourceFront":"埋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"早上在草地上散步，突然看見一條蛇經過，害得我一直流冷汗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-28","sourceFront":"冷汗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡陪家人到公園的草地上野餐，氣氛溫暖又歡喜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-46","sourceFront":"歡喜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-31\",\"日期\",\"日期\",\"日期\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我把搭車的日期、時間都記下來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-31","sourceFront":"日期","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"把考試的日期記在手機裡，這樣做就不會忘了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-32","sourceFront":"這樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆要我照確定的日期去南部出差，如果有什麼改變，他會早點兒通知我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-29","sourceFront":"確定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:為什麼活動中心連一個人都沒有？今天不是有吉他社的表演嗎？ B:你搞錯了，演出日期是下個星期三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-11","sourceFront":"搞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在超市隨手買了瓶飲料，回家後才發現有效日期快到了，只好趕快喝完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-22","sourceFront":"隨手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-36\",\"掉下來\",\"掉下來\",\"掉下来\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條公路很危險，一下大雨，山上的石頭就會掉下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-17","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個地區是個危險地帶，因為經常一下雨就有石頭掉下來，有時候連路都會塌了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-06","sourceFront":"地帶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的鞋底快要掉下來了，得去店裡請人把它粘起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-40","sourceFront":"黏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-21\",\"筆試\",\"筆試\",\"笔试\",\"N/Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次期末的筆試不太難，大家都考得不錯。今天早上考筆試的時候，我寫得太慢了，所以沒寫完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-21","sourceFront":"筆試","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次數學期末考的筆試很難，我有四題寫錯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-28","sourceFront":"題","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"教授說，期末考的筆試比較難，一定要好好地複習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-21","sourceFront":"複習","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這課的漢字我都認得，但還不太會寫，所以筆試時好些字都寫錯了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-29","sourceFront":"認得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-11\",\"表达\",\"表達\",\"表达\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-11","sourceFront":"表達","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個外國學生常跟台灣朋友聊天，用中文表達自己的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-12","sourceFront":"意見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"開會時如果老闆突然變得很安靜，也不表達任何意見時，就表示他生氣了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-21","sourceFront":"表示","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"與人溝通時，最重要的是讓對方清楚了解你想表達的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-04","sourceFront":"與","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，收到禮物的人要找機會回禮，表達自己的感謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-24","sourceFront":"回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人送禮最重心意，以這種方式向收禮的人表達關心與祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-16","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在抗議新建工廠的活動中，當地的環保團體聯合起來表達他們的需求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-38","sourceFront":"聯合","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-05\",\"體力\",\"體力\",\"体力\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的體力很好，每天工作十幾個小時也不累。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-05","sourceFront":"體力","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"健身教練說，等我病好了，體力好一點兒了，就應該繼續慢跑。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-13","sourceFront":"繼續","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"醫生建議這個病人每天跑步三十分鐘，這樣體力、精神就會越來越好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-14","sourceFront":"建議","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"醫生建議這個病人每天跑步三十分鐘，這樣體力、精神就會越來越好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-15","sourceFront":"病人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,