,"english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-10","sourceFront":"撥","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-13\",\"床\",\"床\",\"床\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我平常早上七點起床，八點吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng, bā diǎn chī zǎofàn.","english":"I usually get up at seven and have breakfast at eight in the morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-11","sourceFront":"平常","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"哥哥喜歡在床上看書。","pinyin":"Gēge xǐhuān zài chuáng shàng kànshū.","english":"My elder brother likes to read in bed.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-01","sourceFront":"床","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我今天七點起床。","pinyin":"Wǒ jīntiān qī diǎn qǐchuáng.","english":"I get up at 7:00 today.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-3-03","sourceFront":"起床","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"Under a 广(broad) roof rests a 木(tree) frame → the 床(bed)."},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-10\",\"疯狂\",\"瘋狂\",\"疯狂\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"生命就像一片海洋，有時穩定有時瘋狂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-10","sourceFront":"瘋狂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-47\",\"量\",\"量\",\"量\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我買了一個機器，不但能幫我量體重，還能量身高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-47","sourceFront":"量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他靠自己的力量，經過了十年，終於完成了這個發明。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-01","sourceFront":"靠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"資源回收不分你我他，一個人的回收是榜樣，一群人的回收是力量。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-01","sourceFront":"回收","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"過年時，著名點心店都會收到大量的訂單，甚至有顧客在半年前就下訂單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-16","sourceFront":"訂單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次颱風可能帶來大量雨水，地形較低的地區應該多注意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-12","sourceFront":"大量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"搭飛機時，行李的重量是有限制的，大約一件25公斤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-12","sourceFront":"重量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"個子小的人，不見得力量也小。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-06","sourceFront":"不見得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"易先生從職場退休後，就加入了醫院的服務社團，繼續為社會貢獻一份力量。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-16","sourceFront":"職場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"只有集合大家的力量，有錢出錢、有力出力，才能幫助災民早一點恢復正常生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-32","sourceFront":"出力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"救災工作不容易，一個人的力量是不夠的，得大家一起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-26","sourceFront":"力量","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"鑽石因為無法大量出產，所以才變得珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-37","sourceFront":"鑽石","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"無論發生什麼事，她都會跟父母商量，並參考他們的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-03","sourceFront":"無論","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從採用專家提供的方法後，茶葉的產量已增加百分之五十。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-10","sourceFront":"產量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機鬧鐘的音量及音樂聲，都可按照個人的使用習慣來調整。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-35","sourceFront":"音量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這件事大家都堅持自己的觀點，討論不出結果，還是找個說話有分量的人來決定吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-42","sourceFront":"分量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"At 旦(dawn) the 里(village) stacks grain sacks to measure them → 量(measure)."},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-22\",\"取笑\",\"取笑\",\"取笑\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人都有不小心發生錯誤的時候，不需要取笑別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-22","sourceFront":"取笑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"上門\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Stepping 上(above) into or toward 門(gate): 上門 means usually referring to something turning up at one's door."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"交\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亠(lid) drops onto a 父(father) and locks them together → 交(connect)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"同時\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 同(same) and 時(time): 同時 means at the same time."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"室\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 宀(roof) covers a 至(reach) of floor → one small 室(house)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"密碼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 密(secret) and 碼(number): 密碼 means password."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"斤\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 𠂆(cliff) ledge holds a 丅(T-shape) stamp on the old scale → one 斤(catty)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"百貨公司\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"百(hundred) + 貨(products) + 公司(company) → a company with hundreds of products: department store."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"群\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"An observant 君(sovereign) watches over a flock of grazing 羊(sheep) gathered into a unified 群(group)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"英文\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"英(Yīng) + 文(writing) → the writing of England: 英文(English)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"誤\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Words in 言(speech) that miss the mark: 誤(error)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"講話\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"講(talk) + 話(words) → talking words out loud: 講話(to talk)."}]}
